==Strategy==
This stage contains the incredibly deadly combination of Sir Rels, Raging Bahamut, Ackey, Devil Wife and Manic Lion. Raging Bahamut gets to easily push due to the obstructive peons (and Devil Wife's Surge) clearing the way while Ackey is an incredibly durable backliner that completely invalidates most of those in any player's arsenal. It's best to take out Corrupted Valkyrie quickly, then overwhelm Raging Bahamut Cat with any means necessary or somehow eliminate the Ackeys behind cover. Without either, the stage gets much easier.

As with [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 41|its Heavenly Tower equivalent]], Awakened Bahamut can be used to cheese the stage in combination with the likes of [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell]]; however, here this approach is exhausting and inconsistent. It requires a Rich Cat and other Starting Money Up combos, not to mention Devil Wife can cripple Green Shell, while her Surge can snipe and nuke Bahamut. Even if Bahamut avoids the Surge, support from other rushers are still necessary to destroy the enemy base before Raging Bahamut spawns.

